<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to DevOps CI/CD World</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72, #2a5298);
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            color: white;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: #28a745;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #218838;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>🚀 Welcome to DevOps CI/CD World! 🚀</h1>
    <p>Your application has been deployed successfully.</p>

    <a href="#" class="btn">Explore More</a>
</div>

</body>
</html>
